flowchart TB
    subgraph Browser[React cartographic field notebook]
        Composer[Request composer]
        Map[MapLibre evidence map]
        Cards[Plan, evidence, constraints, weather]
        Trace[Live node, model, tool trace]
        HITL[Typed human decision cards]
        Travel[Checkpoint, fork, replay, compare]
    end

    subgraph API[FastAPI application boundary]
        Routes[Versioned /api/v1 routes]
        DTO[Allow-listed Pydantic DTOs]
        Coordinator[Per-thread mutation coordinator]
        SSE[SSE adapter]
        Views[Safe checkpoint, evidence, map views]
    end

    subgraph Runtime[Phase 3 workflow boundary]
        Manager[BiodiversityRunManager]
        Graph[LangGraph biodiversity workflow]
        Geocoder[Typed named-place resolution]
        Broker[AgentRunEvent broker]
        Checkpointer[(Durable SQLite checkpointer)]
    end

    subgraph ApplicationData[Application-owned persistence and public snapshots]
        Catalog[(SQLite run catalog)]
        Reports[Safe operation reports]
        OSM[Versioned OSM polygons]
        Nominatim[Nominatim search or sanitized fixture]
        Fixtures[Fixture evidence and scripted models]
    end

    Composer -->|202 operation identity| Routes
    Routes --> DTO
    DTO --> Coordinator
    Coordinator -->|worker thread| Manager
    Manager --> Graph
    Graph --> Geocoder
    Geocoder -->|bounded candidates| Nominatim
    Geocoder -->|typed human selection| HITL
    Graph <--> Checkpointer
    Graph --> Broker
    Broker --> SSE
    SSE -->|sequence replay and live events| Trace
    Manager --> Views
    Views --> DTO
    DTO --> Map
    DTO --> Cards
    DTO --> HITL
    DTO --> Travel
    Coordinator <--> Catalog
    Coordinator --> Reports
    SSE -. historical replay .-> Reports
    Views --> OSM
    Graph --> Fixtures

    classDef privacy fill:#174f43,color:#fff,stroke:#0b382f,stroke-width:2px;
    class DTO,Views,Geocoder privacy;
